    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/1002.3082v1" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>  Almost-commuting matrices with respect to the normalized Hilbert-Schmidt norm are considered. Normal almost commuting matrices are proved to be near commuting.</summary>
